{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102202423930-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102232622\"/><p>被捕的私家車司機。</p><p>今晚(2日)7時許，警員巡經油麻地佐敦道近德興街時，發現一輛私家車停於路邊，車上司機形迹可疑，於是上前作出截查。經過搜查，在車上起出100粒懷疑依托咪酯煙彈、及60多小包懷疑可卡因。因此，以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」罪，拘捕該名男司機。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:09.365439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:24:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:29.218068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:29.218068+00:00","content_hash":"2b312623dcacc7763c35520cb6844d57d567ed53db1a97e7d0f88ab7cb2b9e33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}